        "product_summary": "Perforated EVA upper: Round forefoot holes and elongated side openings form the moulded closed-toe clog profile.\n\nPivoted heel strap: The strap can be positioned across the upper or behind the heel, as shown in the actual source photographs.\n\nTextured EVA outsole: Separate forefoot and heel areas are visible in the underside views, with inset colour accents on Beige and Grey.\n\nOpen rear entry: A curved heel cup and broad forefoot give the shoe its casual clog outline.\n\nThree colour options: Black, Grey and Beige are supplied in the paired EU size choices shown in the colour-size chart.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
